# The Immortal Sun {6}: cast on turn 1 off Mana Crypt and four Moxen ({C}{C}{U}{B}{R}{G} pays {6} exactly, the pool empty
# afterwards). "At the beginning of your draw step, draw an additional card." (CR 603.2, 121.1): only the active player
# draws each turn (and the first turn is skipped), so on turn 3 Bot1 holds three cards (the normal plus the extra) and on
# turn 5 four. "Spells you cast cost {1} less to cast." (CR 601.2f, 118.7a): the Grizzly Bears costs just {G} (the pool
# empty after), Bot2's own Bears on turn 2 costs the full {1}{G}, and Ashiok, Dream Render on turn 5 costs {U}{B} instead
# of {1}{U}{B}, and Mind Stone {2} is cast for exactly {1} off Mana Crypt (a {2} reduction would leave {C}{C}, pinning the
# amount from above). "Creatures you control get +1/+1." (CR 604.1): Bot1's Bears is 3/3 while Bot2's stays 2/2. "Players
# can't activate planeswalkers' loyalty abilities." (CR 602.5, 606.3): on turn 7 Ashiok's "-1: Target player mills four
# cards." can't be activated.

